##############################################################################################################
HOW EACH CELL IS COMPUTED
  a, strata             the strata of the locus in the census (st_eff.txt: the class, and nP > 0 for T>S or nM > 0 for T<S),
                        together with those of the probe's blocks of the locus; the rays take the classes C, A and Z
  a, dimensions         the smallest and the largest number of free coordinates among these strata
  a, of dimension 0     the strata with no free coordinate, each a binary strategy
  a, binary-invisible   the strata whose closed cell holds no binary friendly rival of the wedge (m2_masks.npz;
                        census.py's visible_flags), in S over the census's strata only; share = binary-invisible / those strata
  a, T=S and (1,0)      the efficient strata by the support (census_support_class.u8.gz): class C below the switch line,
                        class A above it, and C, A and Z at (1,0)
  b                     per (class, sign) block of the probe: the census's strata of dimension >= 5, the probe's strata,
                        the probe's strata not in the census (the deficit), and all the census's strata of the block;
                        share = deficit / census total

##############################################################################################################
INPUTS
  PartnersRivalsM2f/check/st_eff.txt: 1 524 791 lines (C 1 318 785, A 9802, Z 196 204), K = 64 draws at every stratum
  PartnersRivalsM2f/cannon/ca1_out: the dimension probe (array 45752239), 768 files dim_<class>_<sign>_<stripe>.txt and dim_45752239_<task>.err, 1 123 644 lines
  PRFull/release/census_class/census_support_class.u8.gz: 43 046 721 strata; by the support none 31 580 692, C 6 206 077, A 2 788 386, Z 2 471 566
  PartnersRivals/Figures/m2_masks.npz: binary friendly rivals W 8, S 1519, N 80, E 80; effCC 7639, effALT 3072
  PartnersRivalsM2f/check/binary_eff.npz: effLINE 14757

